100:   // <https://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-ietf-quic-transport-34#section-4.1>`_ size. Valid values range from
101:   // ``1`` to ``16777216`` (``2^24``, maximum supported by QUICHE) and defaults to ``16777216`` (``16 * 1024 * 1024``).
