115:   // Similar to ``initial_stream_window_size``, but for connection-level
116:   // flow-control. Valid values range from ``1`` to ``25165824`` (``24MB``, maximum supported by QUICHE) and defaults
117:   // to ``25165824`` (``24 * 1024 * 1024``).
118:   //
119:   // .. note::
